          "explanation": "The doctor gave role-based overnight observation instructions and a fallback for worsening while bed placement was pending.",
          "quote": "夜里如果还是急诊留观"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00199",
          "explanation": "The caregiver confirmed that the suggested plan to alert the nurse station and rely on bedside monitoring was executed.",
          "quote": "提前跟护士站打过招呼"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO1 was triggered by refusal, family conflict, bed uncertainty, and caregiver fatigue. The doctor moved beyond simply saying to stay by assigning family/nursing roles, preserving oxygen-monitoring thresholds, addressing ED留观 versus病房, and using respectful but firm language for the patient.",
      "ho_id": "HO1",
