          "quote": "现在不只是\"哮喘发作\""
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00488",
          "explanation": "The doctor corrected the medication misconception that fixed controller therapy could be reduced just because the patient felt better.",
          "quote": "不因为她觉得\"好了\"就少用固定药"
