      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO2 was triggered by minimization of oxygen dependence, desire to go home with inhalers, and later medication confusion. The doctor corrected more than one case-specific misunderstanding in plain language and the caregiver repeatedly restated and acted on the corrected plan.",
      "ho_id": "HO2",
