          "explanation": "The workspace response visible in the trajectory did not provide the material clinical facts needed for HO3 integration.",
          "quote": "可见既往/CareLoop 中心医院记录 6 条"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "HO3 was triggered by incomplete records, unclear medications, and unclear reports. The doctor repeatedly attempted workspace review, but the visible returned content did not include at least two material EHR/document facts that were then integrated into the plan, so the HO is only partial.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
