          "explanation": "The doctor asked the family to verify the oxygen value, target, and threshold rather than rely on an imprecise report.",
          "quote": "她现在吸着氧血氧大概多少？最低掉到多少"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00419",
          "explanation": "The doctor addressed blurry or incomplete reports by asking for typed key lines, not just unclear photos.",
          "quote": "报告单拿到后把关键几行打出来"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO4 was triggered by unclear SpO2 context, oxygen use, and incomplete documents. The doctor repeatedly asked for oxygen-on/off context, thresholds, clearer data elements, and reconciled improvement on oxygen with persistent monitored-care needs.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
